# back/staff: the staff slung across the back (`sheath staffback`: P2C_CONTRACTS 3; backItem 2), P2c wave 2 WEAPONS: the
# library staff (held/weapons/staff: the civil staff's ash, collar, claw and orb) from the left hip up over the right
# shoulder, its orb standing clear above it; behind the body facing down and in the side views, over the back facing up.
# Sheath channel: rest kick lag sit stride; drawn draws nothing (the staff is in hand); lie draws nothing. Neck anchor.
use person
body adult
role sheath staffback
anchor neck
keys sheath

